# Highway Robbery: "You may discard a card or sacrifice a land. If you do, draw two cards" (CR 608.2c-d, 701.9, 701.21, 121.1). An Island is played first; sacrificing it (not discarding) draws two: the hand goes 3 -> 5 with the Island in the graveyard and no card discarded.
